op0015 (2026-11-05).\n%\n% Build: `make` in this directory (latexmk -pdf); `make check` fails on any\n% undefined reference or citation. House setup copied from paper1/latex/main.tex\n% (article class, Palatino, natbib plainnat, Appendix A of Lean names).\n%\n% THE TITLE IS FIXED BY THE OWNER AND MUST STAY VERBATIM, INCLUDING THE ELLIPSIS\n% AND THE FINAL PERIOD. The plain string is:\n%   Exponential time hypothesis is false... but the verified algorithm is slower than trying all 2^n assignments at every practical size.\n% In \\title below `$2^n$` and `\\ldots` are its only LaTeX; the pdftitle carries\n% the plain string. The gate (Ralph_Loops/loop0015/gate.py) checks it. Questions\n% about the wording go to ../ETH_AMBIGUOUS.MD, never into the title.\n\\documentclass[11pt,letterpaper]{article}\n\n\\usepackage[T1]{fontenc}\n\\usepackage[utf8]{inputenc}\n\\usepackage[sc]{mathpazo}\n\\linespread{1.05}\n\\usepackage{courier}\n\\usepackage[protrusion=true,expansion=false]{microtype}\n\\usepackage[margin=1in]{geometry}\n\\usepackage{amsmath,amssymb,amsthm}\n\\usepackage{graphicx}\n\\usepackage{booktabs}\n\\usepackage{array}\n\\usepackage{tabularx}\n\\usepackage{longtable}\n\\usepackage{caption}\n\\usepackage{float}\n\\usepackage[section]{placeins}\n\\usepackage{xcolor}\n\\usepackage[hyphens]{url}\n\\usepackage[title,titletoc]{appendix}\n\\usepackage[authoryear,round]{natbib}\n\\usepackage[colorlinks=true,linkcolor=blue!50!black,citecolor=blue!50!black,urlcolor=blue!50!black]{hyperref}\n\\hypersetup{pdftitle={Exponential time hypothesis is false... but the verified algorithm is slower than trying all 2\\string^n assignments at every practical size.}}\n\n\\graphicspath{{figures/}}\n\\numberwithin{figure}{section}\n\\numberwithin{table}{section}\n\\captionsetup{font=small,labelfont=bf}\n\\bibliographystyle{plainnat}\n\n% Lean names live in Appendix A (secA_appendix_lean.tex), one entry per\n% result, as in paper 1: \\leanentry{key}{result} opens a row, \\leannames{a, b}\n% p