n    24\t            Computation.Trace (locatedStep machine) prefixSteps\n    25\t              (locatedInit machine (Encoding.encodeCNF F)) intermediate →\n    26\t            (visitedSpace intermediate : ℝ) ≤\n    27\t              S * ((Encoding.formulaBitLength F : ℝ) + 1) ^ e := by\n    28\t  sorry\n    29\t\n    30\tend OAI.Algorithms.SubexponentialSAT.SqrtLogSpace\n=== gate.py paper3 checks ===\n5:1. `lake build` in lean/ succeeds;\n6:2. every `.lean` file under lean/MOSPFormalization/ (top level, Complex/ and\n7:   Search/) is imported by lean/MOSPFormalization.lean, so the build really\n11:   the entries in allowed_sorries.txt, and no `axiom` declaration exists;\n15:   and `make -C paper3/latex check` once paper3/latex/Makefile exists; skipped\n18:   paper3/latex/main.tex still carries the owner's title verbatim.\n33:LEAN = REPO / \"lean\"\n37:PAPER3 = REPO / \"paper3\" / \"latex\"\n95:    root = (LEAN / \"MOSPFormalization.lean\").read_text()\n96:    for f in sorted((LEAN / \"MOSPFormalization\").rglob(\"*.lean\")):\n99:            print(f\"GATE FAIL: {mod} is not imported by MOSPFormalization.lean\"); ok = False\n101:    sorries, axioms = [], []\n102:    for f in sorted((LEAN / \"MOSPFormalization\").rglob(\"*.lean\")):\n107:            if re.match(r\"\\s*(private\\s+)?axiom\\b\", line):\n108:                axioms.append(f\"{f.relative_to(LEAN)}:{n}\")\n114:    if axioms:\n115:        print(f\"GATE FAIL: axiom declarations: {axioms}\"); ok = False\n126:    # The paper must build cleanly: no undefined references or citations.\n136:            print(\"GATE FAIL: paper3/latex make check\"); ok = False\n138:        # as the pdftitle; `$` and `\\ldots` are the only LaTeX in it (paper3/README.md).\n142:            print(\"GATE FAIL: paper3/latex/main.tex does not carry the owner's title verbatim\"); ok = False\n144:        print(\"paper3/latex/Makefile not present yet: paper 3 check skipped\")\n=== ETH/ refs in paper3 and plan ===\npaper3/latex/secA_appendix_l