h real logarithms and is marked","+  \\texttt{noncomputable}; no \\texttt{\\#eval} can print $\\rho(50)$ or","+  $\\rho(50)/50$. Every number in Section~\\ref{sec:statement} comes from a","+  Python script, not from Lean, and the Lean proves only the limit.","+\\item \\textbf{The match is textual.} ``Character for character'' means","+  the normalised texts are equal; it is not a check at the level of","+  \\texttt{lean4export}, and it rests on the clone being the repository at","+  the commit named.","+\\item \\textbf{The lemmas are trivial on purpose.} They fix the shape of","+  the bound and the limit of the exponent, and nothing else. No theorem","+  about any machine's running time, about the constants, or about the","+  manuscript's sharper exponents is stated, because none is verified.","+\\item \\textbf{The directory name is not a citation.} The files sit in a","+  directory named for another study of ours; nothing from that study","+  enters this paper, and the owner's decision to leave them in place is","+  recorded, not argued.","+\\end{itemize}"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/home/al/dev/MOSP/paper3/latex/sec8_lean.tex"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01NE7xTqYm7bCEdzJrDd2B3W","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
